### Strings for the Test widget, a starter widget that engineers copy to
### make new widgets. It's shown in an iframe on the Firefox New Tab page,
### about 332 pixels wide, so keep strings short. Every ID starts with
### test-.

# Small label above the heading. Written in capitals on purpose; keep the
# casing your language uses for short labels like this.
test-card-eyebrow = FRAMED WIDGET
test-card-heading = Test widget
# Shown until the page hosting the widget replaces it with its own text.
test-card-default-message = Hello from the test widget.
test-card-hello-button = Say hello
